  <data name="Usage" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>bodu-calendar — compile and lint Bodu notable-date rule packs

Usage:
  bodu-calendar lint &lt;file.xml|file.json&gt; [--resolver-dir &lt;dir&gt;]
  bodu-calendar compile &lt;file.xml|file.json&gt; [-o &lt;out.bcal&gt;] [--resolver-dir &lt;dir&gt;]
  bodu-calendar info &lt;file.bcal&gt;

Commands:
  lint      Validate a document and print every BODU-CAL-* diagnostic without compiling.
  compile   Validate a document and compile it to a sealed .bcal binary pack.
  info      Print the header and content summary of a compiled pack.

Options:
  -o, --output &lt;file&gt;     The pack path compile writes; defaults to the input with a .bcal extension.
  --resolver-dir &lt;dir&gt;    A directory whose &lt;name&gt;.xml / &lt;name&gt;.json files satisfy document imports,
                          consulted before the bundled common catalogues.

Exit codes: 0 success, 1 validation or input failure, 2 usage error.</value>
